{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2025-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1756684800, "end_date": 1757375999, "month_true_total": 1026, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:29:12 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203910206", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388544811", "personaname": "Lebby :3", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198388544811/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 20753, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20182, "last_played": 1770424152, "avatar": "ddf4b7a04ef0ff40c73441096facf7a0483211d6"}, "language": "english", "review": "peam", "timestamp_created": 1757374197, "timestamp_updated": 1757374197, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203908578", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032084103", "personaname": "SilentKing", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198032084103/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 19880, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16718, "last_played": 1770932182, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Minecraft with no building and all killing.", "timestamp_created": 1757371857, "timestamp_updated": 1757371857, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "203907913", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117652637", "personaname": "Mobile Shovel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198117652637/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 105622, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 409, "playtime_at_review": 80259, "last_played": 1787892239, "avatar": "7baa13c671732fd13a61ec13f2c4741e1e6ce9b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now that I officially have 1,337 hours in Deep Rock, I think it's time for my review. \n\nThis game is a masterpiece, in my humble opinion. In no other game can you just hop in with any random group and find nothing but positivity and teamwork. Truly, if you want to be able to have fun with a group of randoms, this is the game I would pick hands down. I have very rarely had a negative experience with people in Deep Rock, and although it does happen, I could probably count on both my hands the number of times it's happened in my time with this game. \n\nBesides all that, it's just a damn fun game. There is a lot to do in this game, from varying mission types to unlocking overclocks or cosmetic cores, you'll find something to do for many hours. And even now, after I've unlocked all the cosmetics and overclocks, I still come back just for the gameplay itself. And if you ever find yourself growing bored of running the same stuff over and over again, then you can always sip on a chilly Randoweiser to randomize your run and experience the rush of trying to win with a random loadout. \n\nOverall, I highly recommend this game to anyone, because I think it has something for everyone. Rock and Stone, miners!", "timestamp_created": 1757370936, "timestamp_updated": 1757370936, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 31, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.689713537693023682", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "151